<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n116387" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡρόσκοπ-ος</span></b>  (parox.), ὁ, Astrol., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>caster of
				nativities, astrologer,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς τῶν ὡροσκόπων βοτάνας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					11.798
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			Adj., <i>of the ascendant</i> (v. infr. <i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φέγγεα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Man.
					4.59
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				496
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as
				Subst., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡροσκόπος, ὁ,</span> the sign or degree rising
			at the time of birth, <i>ascendant,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Tetr.</u>
				33
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				130
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				5.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				50
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				61
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				2.8.42
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> pl., of
			certain stellar deities whose names agree in part with those of the 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεκανοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			, from which, however, they are distd., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν λσ́ λαμπρῶν ὡροσκόπων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PLond.</u>
					1.98r15
				</span></i>
			, al., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Myst.</u>
				8.4
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
